         NodePosX=8160
         NodePosY=-128
         NodeWidth=960
         NodeHeight=304
         NodeComment="If the angle is within limits or we have not yet started a wall run, record the normal as the SecondaryTraceNormal, then add it to (and normalize) the AverageWallNormal. This average is the combined normal of the two traces that will control the direction of the wall run."
