         NodePosX=224
         NodePosY=-64
         NodeWidth=1600
         NodeHeight=352
         NodeComment="Gets the current angle of the wall run\'s arc. Finds the Dot product of the player\'s velocity and the same velocity with Z set to 0. Negative values get flipped to positive when doing this, so the final value is multiplied by the sign (1 or -1) of the original Z value."
         NodeGuid=1EF830414C75DC24EFF601A439A0F07A
      End Object
